# Replies to tests/smoke/commands.commands, as the server logs them.
# status
Walkers [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+[^:]*: on, mundane mode "auto"
Config: ModConfig/walkers\.json, problems: 0
Walkers loaded: 0
# config: the list, one setting, a bad value, a value set and saved, then restored
Settings in ModConfig/walkers\.json
^  enabled = true$
mundaneMode = "auto" \(default "auto", "auto" \| "on" \| "off"\)\. Mundane mode drops
Cannot set mundaneMode: expected one of auto, on, off
Saved mundaneMode = "on"
^  mundaneMode "auto" → "on"
\[walkers\] Reloaded ModConfig/walkers\.json: 1 setting\(s\) changed, 0 problem\(s\)
# reload of the file just saved: nothing changes
Reloaded ModConfig/walkers\.json\. Settings changed: 0
Saved mundaneMode = "auto"
^  mundaneMode "on" → "auto"
# spawn: until the creature's entity JSON lands no walker type exists; afterwards it spawns at the world spawn
(Spawned skinwalker-true #[0-9]+ at|No walker entity types are loaded yet)
Removed every loaded walker: [0-9]+
# me is for players only
Caller must be player
